</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land \\forall A\\;(A\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\to \\exists S\\in\\mathcal S\\;(|A\\cap S|=\\omega\\land |A\\setminus S|=\\omega))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land \\forall A\\;(A\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\to \\exists S\\in\\mathcal S\\;(|A\\cap S|=\\omega\\land |A\\setminus S|=\\omega))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC cardinal definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348